Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.81,0:00:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真不该来这儿啊  小子们  -梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You shouldn't have come here, boys. - Meg!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个恶魔  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要上天堂了  小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're goin' to heaven, Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还能怎样啊  你个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what can you do, you impotent sap?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那该死的是个啥东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也许是个始祖  -始祖  就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It may have been an alpha. - An alpha? Like --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是其他怪物的起源\N{\fnArial\fs30}First one who spawned all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面的学问可多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's tons of lore about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你在找炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you're looking for purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-想告诉我们原因吗  -炼狱广袤无垠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to tell us why? - Purgatory is vast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但却未被充分利用  又与地狱毗邻\N{\fnArial\fs30}underutilized, and hell-adjacent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我想要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我猎捕去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越高级的越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim high on the food chain, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们可不是你的雇员  -绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We ain't your employees. - Of course you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不过就是个在十字路口晃悠的恶魔罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but a punk-ass crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是曾经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a punk-ass crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今  已是地狱之王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now? King of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我动动小手指  就能让萨姆的灵魂归位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snap my fingers, Sam gets his soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是再把他丢回牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I shove Sam right back in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anything about --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:02.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  但你那可人的外貌完全得不到任何怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry...But your exceptional good looks aren't gonna buy you any mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,建议你还是乖乖招了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来该试试哪一个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we use next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.33,0:01:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扩张器呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speculum?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是来些新奇的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something more exotic?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  那可是炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:19.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  我死后会去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, I go there when I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没法给你绘张地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I can draw you a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我碰巧知道你就是可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:25.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.59,0:01:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的消息绝对可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sources are unimpeachable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是你们这类的始祖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the father of your entire species.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休想用"很傻很天真"这套糊弄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really not pulling off this dumb-blonde act.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能感激我是有多么努力地去寻找...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you appreciate just how much effort I've gone to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找能够真正伤害你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find something that can actually hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.05,0:01:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  代价就是牺牲了很多你的小辈变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my tinkering has cost several lesser shifters their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是铱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iridium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当稀有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rarer than hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.11,0:01:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿真的超贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have been cheaper to drop a castle on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想我们一致认可  值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think we all agree -- worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不你乖乖地坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start talking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.01,0:02:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不我就把你身上突出来的部分都切掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I start chopping off all the bits that stick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go ahead, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看它能不能让我开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if it makes me want to chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炼狱在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory's where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这畜生究竟打算怎样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with you animals?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你提过这个监狱有个婴儿室吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I tell you this prison has a nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全是你的宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}All yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你有多在意他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how much you care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.45,0:02:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你花了好几个月才让他们回到你的羽翼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've spent months gathering them to your bosom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在没那么不可一世了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so cocky now, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.99,0:02:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到炼狱对我来说无比重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding purgatory's important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.97,0:02:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你五秒钟时间告诉我炼狱在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have five seconds to tell me where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则  我会当着你的面将他们抽筋剥骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, I'll filet them in front of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们的脊骨扔到你腿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}toss their spines in your lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四  三  二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four, three, two --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们都杀了吧  我们会造出更多后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all. We'll make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我脑袋搬家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I kind of lost my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第6季第10集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交通真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, traffic was a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个法国狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One rugaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人找妓女也要向你报告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banging a hooker in a sweet spot called none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧呀  萨姆  恶魔也想幽默一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that, Sam -- demon trying to be funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  原来他是在搞笑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安了  娇娃们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等  别急着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Hold up, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能见到克劳力么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we ever gonna see Crowley again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.46,0:04:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是他只是派他的客串恶魔来领他的猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}or is he just gonna keep sending his demon extras to pick up his laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我知道你在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I know you're speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也看到你嘴唇在蠕动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your lips moving,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我真没搞懂你在说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't understand what you're saying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不说你们的鸟语\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I don't speak little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们过去可是猎杀恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when we used to gank demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  老弟  去他妈的  我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, screw it. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:04:59.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-冷静  -我们一直在帮那该死的克劳力跑腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down. - We have been going on these freakin' Crowley runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可这根本屁用没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's not getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -唯一真的有所变化的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean  - I mean, the only thing that's really changed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都觉得羞耻和无助\N{\fnArial\fs30}is now I need a daily rape shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你说得没错  那我们执行B计划吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're right. Let's go with plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢对了  我们根本就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. We don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想出其他办法之前  抱歉  老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So till we do, sorry, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就只能忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stock up on soap-on-a-rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  如果你想让我的灵魂归位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if you want to get my soul back,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就只能这么做了  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we got to do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要自己的灵魂回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You even want it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是正在为克劳力效命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working for Crowley, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道他会不会信守承诺呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who says he's gonna hold up his end, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没聊天的心情了  你是想说这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess the moment's over. Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.13,0:05:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.42,0:06:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看能回答你的人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know who you can ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.76,0:06:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续拣姐爱听的说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep sweet-talking me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情绝对会峰回路转\N{\fnArial\fs30}this could go a whole new direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格  我可是想你想得不得了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg. I've been dying to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这不是来了  小哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here I am, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那咱现在干点什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你撕成碎片怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout I rip you to shreds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重口味  我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinky. I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不介意的话  我要先来问几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a little Q&A first, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说  你们头儿在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:06:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们会为别人卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we work for somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚好知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to know for a fact
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在和克劳力的小恶魔们打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been juggling Crowley's orphans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说  他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know, don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们已经为见他奔走了几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you been working his beat for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.77,0:07:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没面圣的机会啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean we get face time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为他抓的那些始祖们他关在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he take all those things you snatch up for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用一根棒棒糖跟你赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you an all-day sucker
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是他的老巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's where his majesty's holed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  前戏姐玩儿够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, officially over the foreplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满足我  不然我自己上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satisfy me, or I please myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something funny, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  但你哥我的处境可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? 'cause where I'm sittin' --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  她不敢伤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. She can't do jack squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.03,0:07:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经自身难保了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's totally screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  帮倒忙呢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看她  迪恩  她已经气疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her, Dean. She's furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她要是能杀你  早动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she could kill you, she'd have done it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在逃命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:58.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你们那焦躁不安的样儿  应该没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judging by the level of flop sweat on all of you, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说  你们在躲克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you're running from Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力要赶尽杀绝路西法所有的死忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley would want to hunt down all the Lucifer loyalists
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他才是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}now that he's big man on campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.77,0:08:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做是我也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不能杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她需要我们帮她找到克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs us to get her to Crowley
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好亲手干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she can stick that knife in his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是他死就是她亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him or her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话  我是巴望你俩都死翘翘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope you both lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  你加油哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在知道该怎么做了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know what you got to do now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜哈  你会告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- you're gonna tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,擦  啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把克劳力双手奉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hand you Crowley with a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要让我们跟你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On one condition -- we go with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.43,0:08:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你在把他砍成肉酱前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you help us wring a little something out of him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要帮我们从他那弄到一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you hack him to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-要什么  -这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是  你能不能帮我们得偿所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, can you get us what we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地狱时  我可是阿拉斯泰尔的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apprenticed under Alastair in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你哥哥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩你说  我能否让克劳力对我唯命是从\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dean, can I make Crowley do whatever I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.59,0:09:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a deal, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和两个萌货合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hugs and puppies all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不打算给我们松绑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna untie us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明自己被绑得很爽  就别装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pretend you don't enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想跟我玩亲亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抽什么疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  你抽什么风呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.01,0:09:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  是你想要搞死克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you wanted to screw over Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美梦成真了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又想跟恶魔合作了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to work with a demon again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱是暂时跟恶魔合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working with demons now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这样做是为了不再跟他们纠缠不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this 'cause I want to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃伦和乔都是她杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed Ellen and Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但你不能感情用事  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. But you can't look at this emotionally, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们需要她  -需要个毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need her. - The hell we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小婊子得手后肯定先搞死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little bitch is gonna screw us over so fast --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  所以我们才要先下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Which is why we'll screw her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要一完事  梅格和她手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg and her little posse are dead
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the second we're done with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-前提是他们没先把我们杀掉  -他们不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, if they don't kill us. - They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们有护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're bringing insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.71,0:10:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:36.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.23,0:10:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是...是个金盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It -- it's this...Gold box.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纳粹似乎曾经寻找过这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, nazis were after it back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某人尝试打开  结果整张脸被熔化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone tried to open it, and their face melted off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们觉得是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it's, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好心理准备哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}ready for this? --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ark of the covenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-所以吧  -我来了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So -- I'm here, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盒子在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然相信了  真不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you fell for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是"夺宝奇兵"里的情节诶  小白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the plot of "Raiders," Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我身陷战争之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm mid-battle, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不想管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could give a rat's ass
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和拉斐尔之间的狗屁较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your little pissing match with Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  你听我说  -不  你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to me, Sam --- No, you listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管你在天堂要面对的情况是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you're dealing with up in heaven. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你欠我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能不在乎  但是相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not care, but believe me --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你觉得我们是来谈这个的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, do you think we're here to talk this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I can't just --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.34,0:11:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会追捕你  然后杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will hunt you down and kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样杀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我一定会找到方法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will look until I find out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我不睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need help, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真现身了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  下次我请你吃鸡肉大餐 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Sam, I owe you a chicken dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No big.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是朋友应该做的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what friends do for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力在躲我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's hidden from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.61,0:12:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们应该用强硬手段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like we're gonna have to try this the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.17,0:12:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想知道克劳力在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to know where Crowley is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我知道  我凭什么要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I even knew, why would I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我们的外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're our grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔  我会拿回我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel, I'm gonna get my soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说你能拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says you can get it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很想帮忙  但是很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'd like to help, but I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是你外孙的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your grandson's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心甘情愿替克劳力做事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to work for Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  能让我们单独待会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, can you give us a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是你的血肉至亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果你不想帮我们  我也不能逼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you don't want to help us, I can't make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就想知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just got to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.04,0:13:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么把柄在克劳力手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Crowley holding over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该给我们说清楚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会把她带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna give her back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力要让妈妈起死回生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's gonna bring mom back from the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是说你不想让她回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me you don't want her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们之间有个区别是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the one difference between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的生活可以没有她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to live without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我女儿  她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my daughter, and she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我能让她活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得克劳力会把她带回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think Crowley's gonna make good here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:29.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把萨姆和我都带回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought Sam back! And me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  别走这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me -- don't go down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说放弃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying stop trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样一点好处都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna go nowhere good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔  我知道我们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel, I know we've had our differences,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我是你的外孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm your grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样做是大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this is wrong for so many reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你个伪君子  -我麻烦你吸取我们的教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hypocrite. - I'm asking you to learn from our mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种做法 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing this --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都让我们被那群混蛋牵着鼻子走\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is how the bad guy gets us every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的致命弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our achilles heel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.09,0:14:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然我们一家人都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, it runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会另想办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will figure something else out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  对不起  但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你把她带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, you bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你要怎么跟她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what are you gonna tell her, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉她  你和恶魔做了交易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell her you made a deal with a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.09,0:15:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不肯帮助她的儿子  -够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That you wouldn't help out her sons?! - That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个真复杂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这个送披萨的真的爱这位保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the pizza man truly loves this babysitter...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么一直打她屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}...why does he keep slapping her rear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能她做了什么错事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps she's done something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在看A片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're watching porn?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电视里放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能当着很多男人的面看A片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't watch porn in a room full of dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不能  谈论它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't... talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他鸡冻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now he's got a boner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就干这些啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you boys do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和天使一起看A片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit around watching pornos with angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不应该谈论这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔  有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you here, Samuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.09,0:17:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽也想我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what Mary would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:16.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是我知道的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们猎获的东西  都送到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we bag... ends up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就在这里  折磨它们  审问它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where he tortures them, interrogates them --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没进去过  但那地方极其危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only been outside the place, but it's a death trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.41,0:17:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有克劳力的允许  没人进得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing gets in that Crowley doesn't want in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.64,0:17:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没人出得来  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing gets out -- period.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.81,0:17:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望你们不要走这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you wouldn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我们一起去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是耳根子软  但还不想自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be soft, but I'm not suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.42,0:18:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可记得你哦  小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure remember you, Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为何要跟这群下三滥的东西合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we working with these abominations?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的肉身可喜欢你骂人的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep talking dirty. It makes my meatsuit all dewy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  都给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道克劳力在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know where Crowley is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  之后你再杀了我们跑路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell you so you can just leave us for dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:25.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们哥几个的被弃妄想症挺严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys have serious abandonment issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己知道不\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带你去  可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll show you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're all going together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我凭什么要相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I'm just supposed to trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  你没这么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're not that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把刀给我下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the knife for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没这么傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm not that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还想不想我们带你去找克劳力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want us to take you to Crowley or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:00.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起好好干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was more interested in killing us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他更想干掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}than getting the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是为大家除掉个祸害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did all of us a favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这么拿走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna keep that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took this from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不过是拿回自己的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时后出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.69,0:20:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  别杵在那儿发呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Cass, you could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对我们的计划有点纠结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ambivalent about what we're attempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勇闯恶魔老巢当然比不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, breaking into monster gitmo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱衣舞夜店的一对一服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not exactly a two-for-one in the champagne room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.81,0:20:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定找回萨姆的灵魂是不是明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure retrieving Sam's soul is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.81,0:20:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他能好好活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆的灵魂被困在牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's soul has been locked in the cage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与米迦勒和路西法共处了一年多\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Michael and Lucifer for more than a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只能在他身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they have nothing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发泄怨气\N{\fnArial\fs30}but take their frustrations out on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们强行把那\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we try to force
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,残破的灵魂塞回萨姆的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}that mutilated thing down Sam's gullet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法预知后果会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have no idea what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.14,0:20:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也许是毁灭性的  -你是说他会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It could be catastrophic. - You mean he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.43,0:20:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说他会生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:21:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻痹瘫痪  精神错乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paralysis, insanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.22,0:21:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神上的强烈痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}psychic pain so profound
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会让他一辈子不得安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he's locked inside himself for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你也说我们不能肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're saying you don't know anything for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是有可能会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he could be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是有这可能  没错  -那就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He could be, yes. - Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我严重怀疑这个可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I sincerely doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要是他有事  就由你来治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if he's not fine, then you fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我无从下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I wouldn't know where to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会有办法的  小卡  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you figure it out, Cass! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的他只不过是具该死的躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the guy's a friggin' replicant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.46,0:21:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把灵魂找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果到时有其他问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there are complications,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再想办法处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we will figure out a way to deal with those, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.47,0:21:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆将承受非人的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sam suffers horrifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太安静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems pretty quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并非如此  我感受得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在边门汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me at the side door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会有点太容易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This all seem a little too easy to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.90,0:23:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  快救我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! You j-- you got to get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.05,0:23:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.61,0:23:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真该死  看门的来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Here come the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:23:59.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.51,0:24:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道这是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew this was a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你想要什么  杯子蛋糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, a cupcake?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.51,0:24:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这能挡它们一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that should keep them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.26,0:24:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撑不了多久  有几条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long. How many of them are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.88,0:24:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我精神上支持你们  姐这就去克利夫兰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be pulling for you... from Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.99,0:24:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我不知道事情会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - I didn't know this was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.08,0:24:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好在把我的肉身留给它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bright side -- them chewing up my meatsuit
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给你们赢点时间逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}ought to buy you a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seacrest out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.10,0:24:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是克劳力下的符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a spell, I think, from Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.59,0:24:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要一进这房子  你就无法脱离肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within these walls, you're locked inside your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.42,0:24:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报应啊  贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karma's a bitch, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.73,0:24:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.36,0:24:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备对着空气乱砍一通吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna slash thin air until you hit something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.84,0:24:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看得见它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.13,0:25:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着  挡住它们  这是唯一的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this. Hold them off. It's our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找克劳力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.45,0:25:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着它去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.52,0:25:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉那个伪善的贱货  我来挡住这些狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill the smarmy dick. I'll hold off the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.66,0:25:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么做...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna do that I--
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.53,0:25:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.06,0:25:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从批萨男那里学来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned that from the pizza man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.14,0:25:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水平一流哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a-plus for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.99,0:25:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉浑身都被净化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel so...clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.60,0:25:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意能对付得了地狱犬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, is that gonna work on a hellhound?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.76,0:25:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上就能知道了  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're about to find out. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.33,0:26:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我毛都看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.85,0:26:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cass?! - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.64,0:26:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.63,0:26:41.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.06,0:26:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.31,0:26:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是自迪克·切尼(布什任内的美国副总统)后我做过的最棒的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}best purchase I've made since Dick Cheney.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.85,0:26:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好呀  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.24,0:26:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你管不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above your pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.45,0:26:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.75,0:26:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一件大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.99,0:26:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀  不过到时你们已经死了  参加不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, you'll be too dead to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.32,0:26:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:26:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我不得不干掉你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame I have to do away with you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.58,0:27:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还挺喜欢支使你们的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather enjoyed your indentured servitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.59,0:27:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.32,0:27:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.12,0:27:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我踩到一泡尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing in pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.79,0:27:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当你走运了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider yourself lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.38,0:28:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.21,0:28:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.02,0:28:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是想告解  找牧师去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want forgiveness, find a priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.97,0:28:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让你理解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.12,0:28:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太理解了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.62,0:28:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.85,0:28:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你口口声声血亲至上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk about putting blood first,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好笑的是  这和我老爸之前讲得差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is funny 'cause you sound just like my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.94,0:28:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不同的是  他的确就这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difference is, he actually did!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是血亲至上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am putting blood first!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.93,0:28:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.99,0:28:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽就是我的血脉  我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's my blood! My daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.87,0:28:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我扯什么出卖不出卖  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come at me like I sold you out, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.85,0:28:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还出卖了你的亲生母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold out your own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.87,0:28:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来你可以选她还是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was her or Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.67,0:28:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你选了萨姆  就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you chose Sam -- plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.77,0:28:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is such crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.48,0:28:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道到底发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what really happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.66,0:28:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你选择了恶魔而不是你自己的外孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose a demon over your own grandsons!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.93,0:28:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爱怎么说随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}See it how you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.66,0:28:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道现在的萨姆是个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what Sam is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.76,0:28:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还想让我保护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want me to protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.71,0:28:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.77,0:28:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就是个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.29,0:28:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  说真的  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, really, tell me --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.60,0:28:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说你到底算是个什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what exactly are you supposed to be to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.07,0:29:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来告诉你我算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.93,0:29:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个你不想再看见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy you never want to see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我一定会逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'll make it out of here. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.22,0:29:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一次你见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next time you see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.79,0:29:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.64,0:29:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别以为还有什么下次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think there's gonna be a next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.16,0:29:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天晚上你可都得小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever gets you through the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.02,0:30:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.17,0:30:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力想知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley wants to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.18,0:30:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.28,0:30:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我好好招待你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told me to carve it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为自己很爷们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever makes you feel like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.50,0:30:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你嘴上刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk a mean game.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.81,0:30:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.05,0:30:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早就被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.26,0:31:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好享受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.46,0:31:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.23,0:31:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《肖申克的救赎》是个好片\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Shawshank"'s a great flick,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.52,0:31:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但咱还是把淋浴场景跳过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but let's skip the shower scene, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.68,0:31:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:31:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早饭来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.22,0:32:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我哥干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do with my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.75,0:32:12.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.49,0:32:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就送你一起上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to join him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.89,0:32:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈逼的食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frickin' hate ghouls!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.41,0:32:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.93,0:32:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  你个王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.05,0:32:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.68,0:32:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.84,0:33:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  你完全捅错地儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're sticking that thing in all the wrong places.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.61,0:33:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.07,0:33:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实嚎叫来着嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure were squealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.12,0:33:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.89,0:33:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是个寄宿用的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a host body.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.39,0:33:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个希博伊根的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some girl from Sheboygan,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.17,0:33:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了当演员  搬到了洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}moved to L.A. to be an actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.45,0:33:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点小打小闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably not even the worst thing
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.15,0:33:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对她来讲都不算最惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ever happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.31,0:33:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.65,0:33:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特就在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester's behind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.10,0:33:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大肉块\N{\fnArial\fs30}meatsack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.83,0:34:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.14,0:34:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好呀  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.21,0:34:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上想跟我唠唠嗑不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling chatty this morning, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.38,0:34:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.89,0:34:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想伤着你这漂亮脑袋上的一根毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't want to harm a hair on that pretty little head.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.55,0:34:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.72,0:34:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跟我聊聊你爸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to tell me all about your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.35,0:34:52.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会儿再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.75,0:35:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在该被食尸鬼啃了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be ghoul scat by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.72,0:35:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.74,0:35:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这身衣服我可刚干洗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had this dry-cleaned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.35,0:35:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.45,0:35:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们干嘛抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}to what do I owe the reach-around?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.14,0:35:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.71,0:35:42.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.63,0:35:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.86,0:35:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的拷问专家从不会将手弄脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best torturers never get their hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.53,0:35:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆有话问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam wants a word with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.18,0:35:54.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮到你什么  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.53,0:35:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明知故问\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know damn well.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.16,0:35:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来要回我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.51,0:36:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你好有种哦  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here I thought you just grew some balls, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.84,0:36:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.42,0:36:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  -梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.72,0:36:18.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.34,0:36:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做不到还是不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't or won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.68,0:36:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said "Can't."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.06,0:36:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没骗你  你个拖把头傻大个儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I meant can't, you mop-headed lumberjack.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.70,0:36:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你拽出来已经算我走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was lucky to get this much of you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.17,0:36:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我再回那鬼地方  想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going back in there for the sloppy bits? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.18,0:36:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是没问题  可里面那两只呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, but those two in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.13,0:36:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我怎么知道你有没有撒谎  -你是不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do I know you're not lying? - You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.25,0:36:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这也没差\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.68,0:36:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.77,0:36:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你干嘛想要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, why do you want the thing back?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.43,0:36:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法在牢笼里玩得可开心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan's got one juicy source of entertainment in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.60,0:36:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换作是我  要回那个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd swallow a rag off a bathhouse floor
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.29,0:36:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不如让我去吃屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I took that soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.78,0:36:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想把自己搞残掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want to be a drooling mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.36,0:36:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  虽然我不想这么说  但他是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I hate to say it, but he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.45,0:37:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我懂了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. I get it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.59,0:37:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他归你处置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.31,0:37:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. What are you, crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.02,0:37:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我们唯一的希望  \N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our only hope! 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.93,0:37:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你也听到他说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.08,0:37:06.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没法帮我取回灵魂  他就没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't get it. He's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.42,0:37:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会让我出来的对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll let me back out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.79,0:37:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一刀是为路西法的  你个自以为是的小...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for Lucifer, you pompous little --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.43,0:37:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.66,0:37:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才不懂折磨的奥妙  你个小贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know torture, you little insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.68,0:37:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.88,0:37:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.75,0:37:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一整季咱俩都没对手戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen you all season.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.05,0:37:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你升职了呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You the cavalry now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.41,0:37:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把刀放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the knife down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.60,0:37:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在上面也这么专横么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You that bossy in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.97,0:38:01.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你输给了拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear you're losing out to Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.47,0:38:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这兄弟内斗搞得可真够激烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole affair makes Vietnam look like a roller derby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.47,0:38:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.57,0:38:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这礼品袋里装着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's in the gift bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.93,0:38:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.59,0:38:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.83,0:38:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的骨头藏得可没那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't hide your bones as well as you should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.97,0:38:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cookie for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.97,0:38:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底能不能弄回萨姆的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you restore Sam's soul or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能在其他方面帮到你们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can help out in any other --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.87,0:38:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.16,0:38:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.30,0:39:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不说  她很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's smart. I'll give her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.95,0:39:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来也想连她一起干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna kill her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.53,0:39:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我会让你们先独处一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course, I'd have given you an hour with her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.72,0:39:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,独处一会要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.78,0:39:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.55,0:39:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hadn't have been for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.42,0:39:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley was right. It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.22,0:39:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在天上并不顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going well for me upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.94,0:39:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们要是能帮上忙...  -你们帮不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If there's anything we can do... - There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.80,0:40:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想事情发展成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish circumstances were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.26,0:40:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多时候...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much of the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.71,0:40:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更愿意留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.68,0:40:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我们知道你忙得焦头烂额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Cass, we know you got a steaming pile on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.00,0:40:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need for apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.96,0:40:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.31,0:40:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Sam --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.31,0:40:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会另想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.58,0:40:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.33,0:40:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处理下那一屋子始祖吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison full of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.71,0:40:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既不能丢下不管  也不能放了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't just leave 'em, can't let 'em go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.17,0:40:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.31,0:40:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.89,0:40:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.24,0:40:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}About your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.02,0:40:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure something else out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.81,0:40:41.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.09,0:40:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢  就因为克劳力说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, why, because Crowley said --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.65,0:40:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力说的你也听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what Crowley said.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.44,0:40:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也听到小卡说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I heard what Cass said.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.73,0:40:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂回到我的身体会将我撕成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting this thing back in would smash me to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.89,0:40:51.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们也不能确定  -知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know that for sure. - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.81,0:40:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当天使和恶魔的意见达成共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}When angels and demons agree on something --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.75,0:40:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁可能不上心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me nuts, I pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.48,0:40:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在才说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.31,0:41:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们差点为这破事死掉...  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After we practically died trying to -- - exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.60,0:41:01.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们差点就没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost got ourselves killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.88,0:41:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还要干多少次这种傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how many times do we risk our asses for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.26,0:41:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.00,0:41:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -我不想要回灵魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam -- - I don't think I want it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.53,0:41:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都不知道自己在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.89,0:41:12.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我说的话你不爱听\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm saying something you don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.13,0:41:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你显然相当在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You obviously care a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.20,0:41:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想  我可能还是不要的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think maybe I'm better off without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.62,0:41:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.70,0:41:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你简直大错特错  -我可不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know how wrong you are. - I'm not sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.06,0:41:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, don't walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.14,0:41:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.96,0:41:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!!
